## A Step-by-Step Guide to Filing Your Beverly Hills Lemon Law Claim

- Bring your vehicle to a manufacturer-authorized repair facility.

- Keep a detailed record of every repair attempt. Collect:

- A clear description of the issues with your vehicle.

- Dates when the repairs were made.

- The amount of time your vehicle spent in the repair shop.

- Copies of invoices and receipts for all services.

- Any communication with the manufacturer or dealer regarding your vehicle’s defects.

